Package: GUImorphWeb
Type: Package
Title: Graphical User Interface for Morphometrics
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-08-14
Author: Erik Otarola-Castillo  
Maintainer: Erik Otarola-Castillo <eoc@purdue.edu>
Description: GUI to R programs to digitize in 3D, conduct geometric morphometric
    analyses and plot results, rendered in the browser with three.js over a
    local httpuv loopback server (no native OpenGL or Tk). Runs on Windows and
    macOS; landmark, curve and surface semilandmark data are written in a format
    directly compatible with geomorph.
Imports:
    geomorph (>= 4.1.1),
    Rvcg,
    httpuv
Encoding: UTF-8
License: GPL (>= 2)
LazyData: true
Suggests:
    htmlwidgets,
    testthat
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
